{{ project_description }}

TypeScript web application using Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS, pnpm, Biome, tsc, Vitest, and Playwright.

## Quick Reference

| Command | Purpose |
| ------- | ------- |
| `just fmt` | Check formatting |
| `just fmt-fix` | Fix formatting |
| `just lint` | Check linting |
| `just lint-fix` | Fix linting |
| `just typecheck` | Run type checker |
| `just test-unit` | Run unit tests |
| `just test-integration` | Run integration tests |
| `just test-e2e` | Run e2e tests (Playwright) |
| `just test-all` | Run all tests |
| `just test-external` | Run tests hitting external services |
| `just gate` | Fast pre-push check (fmt + lint + typecheck + test-unit) |
| `just gate-expensive` | Full check (gate + integration + e2e) |
| `just gate-external` | Everything (gate-expensive + external) |
| `just dev` | Start Next.js dev server |

## Project Structure

```
src/
  app/                        # Next.js App Router
    layout.tsx                # Root layout
    page.tsx                  # Home page
    api/health/route.ts       # Health endpoint
  components/                 # React components
{%- if include_shadcn %}
    ui/                       # shadcn/ui components
{%- endif %}
  hooks/                      # Custom React hooks
  lib/                        # Utilities and configuration
    api.ts                    # API client utilities
    config.ts                 # zod-based env/config validation
    logging.ts                # pino setup
    telemetry.ts              # OpenTelemetry setup
  services/                   # Business logic
{%- if include_database %}
  db.ts                       # Prisma client setup
  repositories/               # Data access layer
{%- endif %}
tests/
  unit/                       # Vitest unit tests
  integration/                # Vitest integration tests
  e2e/                        # Playwright e2e tests
```

## Key Conventions

- Source code lives in `src/`.
- Uses Next.js App Router for routing and API routes.
- Health endpoint is available at `/api/health`.
- Tests are organized by type in `tests/unit/`, `tests/integration/`, `tests/e2e/`.
- Use `external` in test names for tests that hit external services.
- All config is in `package.json` and `tsconfig.json` — no separate config files.
- Run locally with `pnpm next dev` or `just dev`.

